# 🏢 3️⃣ Important Defence Organizations

---

## DRDO

Defence Research and Development Organisation

Role:

* Develops defence technology
* Missiles
* Radars
* Electronic warfare systems

Examples:

* Agni
* Akash
* Many indigenous defence systems

---

## HQ IDS

Headquarters Integrated Defence Staff

Role:

* Coordination among Army, Navy, Air Force
* Joint planning

---

## Integrated Theatre Commands (Concept)

Purpose:

* Better coordination among all services
* Joint operations under unified command

---

# ⭐ 4️⃣ Chief of Defence Staff (CDS)

Role:

* Principal Military Adviser
* Promotes jointness among services
* Supports integration of military operations

---

# 🛰️ 5️⃣ Other Important Organizations

